{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266blWVNgyKz1795045173.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>持有美國國債最多的三個國家，都在9月減持美債。</p><p></p><p>美國財政部數據顯示，持有最多美債的日本，9月減持52億美元美債，連續第五個月減持，持有量降至10,631億美元。英國就減持87億美元美債，連續第二個月減持，最新持有量降至9,858億美元。中國減持268億美元美債，連續四個月減持，持有量降至5,639億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:43:54.874152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:17:17.302049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T00:37:18.061446+00:00","content_hash":"5bb87a96b7b616021dffe35b526ff90c4fc12f0d01bd9367484c0e1cda682531","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:43:54.874152+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}